= watched-run: literal --show, regex --show-rx, a SUMMARY file per sweep
The --show flag matches literals and --show-rx a Raku regex (as many of each as needed); every
sweep writes a SUMMARY file beside its log. AGENTS.md records that the eval server budgets its own
heap now, so the manual jobs x heap arithmetic is gone from the instructions.
