= Docs: Phase 5 coverage campaign -- the gate, the table, the desugar door
t/ is the Phase 5 gate and the coverage table is measured after every batch. The hash/list
binder bug bisects to BOOTSTRAP's 'new': one block, and an interaction. The op-desugar wall
(~590 blocks) has a door, the registered desugars, and enabling all 19 is worth measuring.
List constructors land at 80.6%, native attribute references at 81.7%, with the ranking of
what remains after them.
